  ├─ WF3/3: {Business,Customer,Lead,Entities,tenant_id,lead_id,full_name,phone,email} → HTTP update_lead {lead_id,full_name,phone,email,tenant_id} → Return {success,action}
  └─ WF3/4: {business,customer,lead,conversation,tenant_id} → Return {success,action:OTHER}
